	)
	(text "SPI NOR flash, Macronix MX25R6435F (64Mbit / 8MB, 1.65V-3.6V, ultra low power mode by default)\nShares the CAN controller SPI bus: CAN_SCK, CAN_SDI (MOSI), CAN_SDO (MISO)\nChip select is FLASH_CS = S1J2 pin 17 (was ACCELL_INT2, ASM330 INT2 is now unconnected)\nSupplied from always-on PP3V3: deep power-down current is only a few uA (nA-range typical), so no power switching is needed\nExposed pad is tied to GND (allowed by the datasheet), keep other nets and vias away from it\nPlace C1 at the VCC pin (datasheet: about 0.1uF close to the package)\nSame WSON-8 6x5mm footprint and pin-out: MX25R3235FZNIL0 (4MB), W25Q64JVZPIQ (8MB), W25Q128JVPIQ (16MB)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "62bc0393-ee2d-4d84-9287-3e27b6290046")
	)
